===Pronunciation===
* {{ar-IPA|مَخْزَن}}

===Noun===
{{ar-noun|مَخْزَن|m|pl=مَخَازِن}}

# [[storeroom]], [[storehouse]]
# [[depository]]
# [[stockroom]], [[storage]] room
# [[depot]], [[warehouse]]
# [[store]], [[shop]], [[department store]]
